#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-osd-overview-4.2.rst:5
#: 128bf90d3ae2452eb0f448e811f92cf4
msgid "MSP OSD"
msgstr "MSP OSD"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-osd-overview-4.2.rst:6
#: 127789f1f63c4861825069aa38bca4ee
msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports several types of On Screen Displays (OSD) using MSP "
"(MultiWii Serial Protocol) based protocols:"
msgstr "ArduPilot 支持多种使用基于 MSP（MultiWii 串行协议）协议的屏幕显示（OSD）类型："

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-osd-overview-4.2.rst:8
#: ba2c4278e4c14e35b14ba000c7d77974
msgid ""
"MSP Telemetry based OSDs such as DJI FPV Goggles V1/V2, DJI Goggles RE, "
"FatShark ByteFrost, FatShark SharkByte (before fw 09042021), older `MWOSD "
"<http://www.mwosd.com/>`__ (newer versions support MAVLink, see "
":ref:`common-minim-osd-quick-installation-guide`) , etc."
msgstr ""
"基于 MSP 数传的 OSD，例如 DJI FPV 眼镜 V1/V2、DJI Goggles RE、FatShark "
"ByteFrost、FatShark SharkByte（fw 09042021 之前版本）、旧版 `MWOSD "
"<http://www.mwosd.com/>`__ （新版支持 MAVLink，见 :ref:`common-minim-osd-quick-"
"installation-guide`）等。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-osd-overview-4.2.rst:9
#: ff36f276a68b4cb187dee1a646413c3e
msgid ""
":ref:`DisplayPort <common-displayport>` based OSDs such as HDZero "
"(previously known as FatShark SharkByte (fw 09042021 and later)), Walksnail,"
" DJI goggles using the `wtf-os <https://github.com/fpv-wtf/wtfos>`__ "
"firmware and `msdp-osd module <https://github.com/fpv-wtf/msp-osd>`__, and "
"MWOSD's DisplayPort mode/firmware."
msgstr ""
"基于 :ref:`DisplayPort <common-displayport>` 的 OSD，例如 HDZero（前称 FatShark "
"SharkByte（fw 09042021 及更新版本））、Walksnail、使用 `wtf-os <https://github.com/fpv-"
"wtf/wtfos>`__ 固件和 `msdp-osd 模块 <https://github.com/fpv-wtf/msp-osd>`__ 的 DJI"
" 眼镜，以及 MWOSD 的 DisplayPort 模式/固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-osd-overview-4.2.rst:11
#: fe7978a0d897456d8a395a6b6dd0719d
msgid ""
"Telemetry only based OSDs will render OSD panel items on screen with their "
"own engine based on the standard MSP telemetry sensor messages sent using "
"Serial port protocol \"32\", so ArduPilot has no control of how the items "
"look."
msgstr ""
"纯数传 OSD 将使用自身引擎，基于通过串口协议「32」发送的标准 MSP 数传传感器消息在屏幕上渲染 OSD 面板项目，ArduPilot "
"无法控制这些项目的显示方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-osd-overview-4.2.rst:13
#: 73318682f25f4d65bfb419cafd9d2c51
msgid ""
"DJI 2/V1/V2 goggles also have an extended protocol which is sent using "
"Serial port protocol \"33\" that allows position information for each OSD "
"panel when using their extended Custom OSD feature. This also allows the "
"display of any ArduPilot OSD panel."
msgstr ""
"DJI 2/V1/V2 眼镜还有一个扩展协议，通过串口协议「33」发送，允许在使用其扩展自定义 OSD 功能时为每个 OSD "
"面板指定位置信息。这也允许显示任何 ArduPilot OSD 面板。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-osd-overview-4.2.rst:15
#: 8023c2ee319843ff9eed31f89c6e9ee2
msgid ""
"DisplayPort, on the other hand, is an MSP protocol extension that allows "
"ArduPilot to specify text characters/icons and their positions to be drawn "
"on external OSD displays like it does on internal integrated analog OSDs "
"using Serial port protocol \"42\". DisplayPort is also known (incorrectly) "
"as CANVAS MODE. Basically it’s a remote text only frame buffer that uses "
"local fonts (local to the rendering engine i.e. the OSD hardware) to render "
"strings sent via MSP."
msgstr ""
"DisplayPort 则是一种 MSP 协议扩展，允许 ArduPilot 通过串口协议「42」指定文字字符/图标及其在外部 OSD "
"显示屏上绘制的位置，与在内部集成模拟 OSD 上的操作方式相同。DisplayPort 也（不准确地）被称为 CANVAS "
"MODE。本质上它是一个远程纯文字帧缓冲区，使用本地字体（渲染引擎即 OSD 硬件本地的字体）来渲染通过 MSP 发送的字符串。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-osd-overview-4.2.rst:18
#: 430c1a43c384494a8f8ab46ff53d67ad
msgid "Telemetry based OSD"
msgstr "基于数传的 OSD"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-osd-overview-4.2.rst:19
#: 94fbd178eff84ff4a2015be7ad836d45
msgid ""
"Telemetry based OSDs will render OSD panel items on screen with their own "
"engine, so ArduPilot has no control of how the items look. Another "
"limitation of telemetry based OSDs is that there's no way for ArduPilot to "
"add new panel items at will, it's the vendor's responsibility to add new "
"features by rolling out new firmware releases."
msgstr ""
"基于数传的 OSD 将用自身引擎在屏幕上渲染 OSD 面板项目，ArduPilot 无法控制这些项目的外观。另一个限制是 ArduPilot "
"无法随意添加新面板项目，添加新功能是供应商通过发布新固件版本来实现的。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-osd-overview-4.2.rst:21
#: 17619ca462eb4bc58d78636e8bf93965
msgid ""
"If an on-board integrated analog OSD is present and the user wishes to have "
"both OSDs , it can be activated as well. For example, on vehicles using the "
"DJI goggles/air system for medium range, but still running a long range "
"analog VTX using the internal OSD, for when the vehicle exceeds the range of"
" the HD DJI Goggles. This configuration could use one OSD screen optimized "
"for DJI Goggles, and another for the integrated OSD and the user can switch "
"between them depending on which video system is being viewed."
msgstr ""
"如果存在板载集成模拟 OSD，且用户希望同时使用两种 OSD，也可以激活它。例如，在使用 DJI 眼镜/图传系统进行中距离飞行的飞行器上，同时还使用内部"
" OSD 运行长距离模拟图传，以便飞行器超出 HD DJI 眼镜范围时使用。此配置可以使用一个为 DJI 眼镜优化的 OSD 屏幕，另一个用于集成 "
"OSD，用户可根据正在查看的视频系统在两者之间切换。"

