#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-osd-overview-4.2.rst:30
#: 7827fe017b994df0894d5bcd5b5f6b52
msgid ""
":ref:`MSP_OPTIONS<MSP_OPTIONS>` bit 0 = 0 (Do not EnableTelemetryMode) if "
"the Air Unit is to be connected by both RX and TX input to the AutoPilot "
"Serial port TX/RX. Set bit 0 = 1 (EnableTelemetryMode) if a standalone OSD "
"unit connected only via a single wire from its RX input to the Serial ports'"
" TX. This is known as \"push\" mode."
msgstr ""
":ref:`MSP_OPTIONS<MSP_OPTIONS>` 第 0 位 = 0（不启用数传模式），当空中单元通过 RX 和 TX "
"双向连接到飞控串口的 TX/RX 时使用。如果独立 OSD 单元仅通过一根线从其 RX 输入连接到串口 TX，则设置第 0 位 = "
"1（启用数传模式），这被称为「推送」模式。"

