"除原生 MSP 纯数传 OSD 显示外，后续型号新增了「自定义 OSD」功能，允许显示和定位 ArduPilot 提供的任意或全部 OSD "
"信息面板、警告、单位等。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-osd-overview-4.2.rst:123
#: 458ec76a772b4b048c1e0771cbb3a978
msgid ""
"To enable this, set the following parameters (example using SERIAL port 2 as"
" the port to attach to the DJI Air unit using both TX and RX lines):"
msgstr "要启用此功能，请设置以下参数（示例使用 SERIAL 端口 2 连接 DJI 空中单元，同时使用 TX 和 RX 线）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-osd-overview-4.2.rst:125
#: 7503762dc0ad40429cf6e18fcb4fafa3
msgid ""
":ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` = 3 if no integrated OSD is being used in order to"
" activate the OSD code. If an integrated OSD is present and the user wishes "
"to have both OSDs , then :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` = 1 will activate the on-"
"board OSD as well as providing screens for the MSP OSD function. For "
"example, on vehicles using the DJI goggles/air system for medium range, but "
"still running a long range VTX using the internal OSD for when the vehicle "
"exceeds the range of the HD DJI Goggles. This configuration could use one "
"OSD screen optimized for DJI Goggles, and another for the integrated OSD and"
" the user can switch between them depending on which video system is being "
"viewed."
msgstr ""
":ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` = 3，如果未使用集成 OSD，以激活 OSD 代码。如果存在集成 OSD 且用户希望同时使用两种 "
"OSD，则 :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` = 1 将同时激活板载 OSD 并为 MSP OSD 功能提供屏幕。例如，在使用 DJI"
" 眼镜/图传系统进行中距离飞行的飞行器上，同时使用内部 OSD 运行长距离图传，以便飞行器超出 HD DJI 眼镜范围时使用。此配置可以使用一个为 "
"DJI 眼镜优化的 OSD 屏幕，另一个用于集成 OSD，用户可根据正在查看的视频系统在两者之间切换。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-osd-overview-4.2.rst:126
#: 719d3eca3c5344d282972e8baaa6c5ff
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 33 (DJI FPV)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 33（DJI FPV）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-osd-overview-4.2.rst:128
#: 8da27cfc89eb4312a51cabcb28bf1e3c
msgid ":ref:`MSP_OPTIONS<MSP_OPTIONS>` bit 0 = 0 (Do not EnableTelemetryMode)"
msgstr ":ref:`MSP_OPTIONS<MSP_OPTIONS>` 第 0 位 = 0（不启用数传模式）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-osd-overview-4.2.rst:129
#: b0c0d6a65f484efca2e491544e712074
msgid ""
":ref:`MSP_OPTIONS<MSP_OPTIONS>` bit 2 = 1 (EnableBTFLFonts) forces ArduPilot"
" to impersonate Betaflight and use a Betaflight compatible font index for "
"the font table integrated in the remote OSD system. This is required since "
"the goggles do not have an ArduPilot compatible fonts table."
msgstr ""
":ref:`MSP_OPTIONS<MSP_OPTIONS>` 第 2 位 = 1（EnableBTFLFonts），强制 ArduPilot 模拟 "
"Betaflight 并使用与 Betaflight 兼容的字体索引访问远程 OSD 系统中集成的字体表。由于眼镜没有 ArduPilot "
"兼容字体表，因此需要此设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-osd-overview-4.2.rst:130
#: 0ef1507b6947402294e7e398765545bd
msgid ""
":ref:`OSD_OPTIONS<OSD_OPTIONS>` bit 5 = 1 (TranslateArrows) use corrected "
"direction arrows when using the Betaflight fonts."
msgstr ""
":ref:`OSD_OPTIONS<OSD_OPTIONS>` 第 5 位 = 1（TranslateArrows），在使用 Betaflight "
"字体时使用校正后的方向箭头。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-osd-overview-4.2.rst:132
#: b5a1eea0177a46dca022d8968b857cca
msgid ""
"Serial port buad rate default is changed to 115.2Kbaud automatically when "
"setting the above protocol type. However, if the user has previously or "
"subsequently changes the baud, this default will not be used. 115.2Kbaud is "
"required by most video goggle systems."
msgstr ""
"设置上述协议类型时，串口波特率默认自动更改为 115.2Kbaud。但如果用户之前或之后更改了波特率，则不会使用此默认值。大多数视频眼镜系统需要 "
"115.2Kbaud。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-osd-overview-4.2.rst:134
#: 429a1c56d2034bc09ccb5134b40c885f
msgid ""
"DJI Custom OSD must be enabled: in SETTINGS->DISPLAY->CUSTOM OSD menu of "
"goggles."
msgstr "必须在眼镜的 SETTINGS->DISPLAY->CUSTOM OSD 菜单中启用 DJI 自定义 OSD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-osd-overview-4.2.rst:137
#: 61faf0cafc2d45018ee3a0eb1cd27b02
msgid "Using Mission Planner to Configure the Layout"
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 配置布局"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-osd-overview-4.2.rst:138
#: 1eef3bc172dd4a70b2b936e8a92ccbed
msgid ""
"Mission Planner(MP) has a tab in its CONFIG menu to configure the on-board "
"OSD many autopilots integrate, as well as setup layouts for Displayport "
"OSDs. This same configuration tab can be used to configure the OSD panels."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner（MP）在其 CONFIG 菜单中有一个选项卡，用于配置许多飞控集成的板载 OSD，以及设置 DisplayPort "
"OSD 的布局。同样的配置选项卡也可用于配置 OSD 面板。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-osd-overview-4.2.rst:140
#: e0427640a47a4d17a018a54e287eb402
msgid ""
"Mission Planners' OSD setup screen now supports HD OSD configuration. To "
"enable it check \"HD Layout\" in Editor Options at the top right of the OSD "
"screen you want to change."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 的 OSD 设置界面现支持 HD OSD 配置。要启用，请在要更改的 OSD 屏幕右上角的编辑器选项中勾选「HD "
"Layout」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-osd-overview-4.2.rst:146
#: 2c0674c6dff545338c3288424c539a7a
msgid ""
"You can change the MSP OSD display configuration by connecting Mission "
"Planner to SITL while the MSP OSD emulation window is active. By doing this,"
" you can adjust and tweak your OSD configuration using SITL without having "
"to worry about overheating your VTX. Once you are done you can take the OSD "
"parameters you have settled on and move them to your vehicle."
msgstr ""
"你可以在 MSP OSD 模拟窗口处于活动状态时，通过将 Mission Planner 连接到 SITL 来更改 MSP OSD "
"显示配置。这样你无需担心 VTX 过热，即可在 SITL 中调整 OSD 配置。完成后，可以将确定的 OSD 参数迁移到实际飞行器上。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-msp-osd-overview-4.2.rst:148
